# ============================================================================
# Termux P0 baseline - DEFAULT DENY
# Semua isi HOME diabaikan, hanya file proyek yang di-whitelist.
# Tujuan: cookie, kredensial, log, media, cache, dan backup tidak pernah
# bisa ikut ter-stage, bahkan oleh `git add .`.
# ============================================================================

/*

# --- Proyek aktif (satu-satunya yang dilacak) ---
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/INSTALL.md
!/install.fish
!/downloader.sh
!/downloader/

# --- Pertahanan berlapis (redundan, tapi eksplisit) ---
/cookies/
/.config/
/.local/
/installers/
/logs/
/storage/
*backup*/
*.tar.zst
*.tar.gz

# --- Rahasia / kredensial ---
*.env
.env
.env.*
auth.json
service.json
*credentials*
*token*
*cookie*

# --- Log & artefak ---
*.log
/downloader/logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp
*.swp
